{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"edits\": [],\n  \"note\": \"不作修改。四份评委意见均明确指出，当前稿与别版 r79l 从 S01 到 S13 的正文、段落顺序、心理内容及承接标注完全相同，没有任何可辨认的实质差异。因此，无法确认有哪项内容是在替换过程中丢失、需要带回的。逐段核对后，当前稿已经保留了主要的心理转折：S05 写出了不服气逐渐淡去背后的疲惫，S06 写出了对亲近生活的重新接纳，S07 写出了安宁被孤独感打断后的动摇，S11 写出了害怕仍在却决定先把日子过稳的选择，S12、S13 则保留了最终不再逼自己选边、带着想念继续生活的态度。珠子中关于 S07 的骤然惊醒、S09 的旧问题重新浮现、S13 结尾的孤悬感等听感，虽然有进一步表现的可能，但没有证据证明它们属于别版已有而当前稿丢失的实质内容。此时补写反而会把音乐解释扩展成人物的新心理动作，破坏当前稿的简洁。保留原稿，也不削弱最终选择。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "63bd4079-1a71-4b29-9e62-995f5423fb5c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T203552920078Z", "elapsed_seconds": 16.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T20:36:09.602894+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4583552013e14ef1b1f63f8c5ce5600332dc4d4c61a721a98021d6355bb8ad0d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py":